{"sections":[{"id":"h.5b6atqept8f","title":"Beginning of Shadows of War","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179065","runs":[{"text":"→ Shadows of War - the Alliance goes on the offensive and launches an attack on the Queen's castle ("},{"text":"/join shadowwar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadow-war-location"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179183","runs":[{"text":"→ When Dragons Rage, where you flee from Malgor the Shadowlord with Varga the Warfury ("},{"text":"/join shadowlordkeep","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadowlord-keep"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179293","runs":[{"text":"→ You've stolen through Shadowlord Malgor's keep and entered the rift in the sky ("},{"text":"/join timestream","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/timestream"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179394","runs":[{"text":"→ Teja the Pirate Queen, try to convince a Pirate Queen to join your side ("},{"text":"/join granitecove","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/granite-cove"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179489","runs":[{"text":"→ Pirate Queen's Favor, fight to stay alive and uncaptured as Pirate Queen Teja's crew shows their true colors ("},{"text":"/join blackseakeep","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/blacksea-keep"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179622","runs":[{"text":"→ Cat Burglar's Hoard, quest to recover the Pirate Queen's Gem from the Kittarian, Jinx ("},{"text":"/join junkhoard","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/junkhoard"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179729","runs":[{"text":"→ Jinx's Quest, fall into a dimension of junk on your quest to find the Pirate Queen's Gem ("},{"text":"/join junkheap","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/junkheap"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179838","runs":[{"text":"→ Attack on Arcangrove, defend Arcangrove from Malgor's forces ("},{"text":"/join shadowgrove","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadowgrove"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-179922","runs":[{"text":"→ The Spirit Mage, Work with Mahou the Spirit Liaison to stop Malgor ("},{"text":"/join aozorahills","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/aozora-hills-location"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180012","runs":[{"text":"→ In our quest to stop "},{"text":"Mahou"},{"text":", we sought the aid of Mahou the Spirit Mage ("},{"text":"/join ghostnexus","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ghost-nexus"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180105","runs":[{"text":"→ Attack on Mythsong, find the song before Malgor's minions do and drive the invaders out of Mythsong ("},{"text":"/join shadowsong","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadowsong"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180227","runs":[{"text":"→ Evil Alliance, defend Dage's Underworld from Malgor ("},{"text":"/join darkally","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-ally"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180299","runs":[{"text":"→ Dage vs Nulgath, help Dage defeat the dark alliance that is Nulgath and Malgor ("},{"text":"/join darkalliance","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/dark-alliance"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180402","runs":[{"text":"→ ShadowFlame vs ShadowScythe, defend Shadowfall against the invading Shadowflame army ("},{"text":"/join innershadows","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/inner-shadows"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180512","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":":\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180536","runs":[{"text":"→ Shadowflame Army: "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jrMVFB-mfdo"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LicgUKAtmtw"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-180572","runs":[{"text":"→ Pirate Queen Teja: "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_-nXp36JUA"},{"text":" - "},{"text