ow Chaos Fusion, join Drakath and Teja on the most unusual island they've ever seen ("},{"text":"/join lagunabeach","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/laguna-beach"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181168","runs":[{"text":"→ It is time to retrieve the Chaos Amulet from Captain Laguna ("},{"text":"/join laguna","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/laguna"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181246","runs":[{"text":"→ Attack on the Mirror Realm, "},{"text":"Drakath has recovered the Amulet of Chaos, and now Malgor must find the only way to stop him ("},{"text":"/join shadowoff","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadowoff"},{"text":" and "},{"text":"/join brightshadow","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/brightshadow"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181411","runs":[{"text":"→ Malgor is sending one of his most trusted Shadowflame Generals and Xing, the Mirror Twin that betrayed Drakath ("},{"text":"/join brightchaos","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/bright-chaos"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181545","runs":[{"text":"→ Fight to save the Mirror Realm, only the power of the Eternal Dragon of Time can end the attacks by Malgor the ShadowLord and his army of darkness ("},{"text":"/join brightforest","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/bright-forest"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181716","runs":[{"text":"→ You must go into the past to help save the Mirror Realm in your time ("},{"text":"/join brightforestpast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/bright-forest-past"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181814","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":":\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181838","runs":[{"text":"→ Chaos Duality: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H2LilHBJp_A&pp=ygUNZHVhbHBsYW5lIGFxdw%3D%3D"},{"text":"\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181866","runs":[{"text":"→ Chaos Amulet: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0n31Ry5ZO5k"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181893","runs":[{"text":"→ Laguna: "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RJqHVfDy2oM"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PbHszZFAAUM"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181919","runs":[{"text":"→ Mirror Realm: "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gg6rd8cThgU"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9cY-NLLkZ9w"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_mP_8sl5Qc"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-181960","runs":[{"text":"→ Finale: "},{"text":"Click here","italic":true,"href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I1AVAateRzE"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.nvhi81s4fj7b","title":"ShadowFlame Onslaught","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182006","runs":[{"text":"Note:","italic":true},{"text":" Shadows of War II bao gồm cả ShadowFlame Onslaught và Shadows of War Finale.\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182089","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Plane of Fire Invasion, Malgor has joined forces with one of your old enemies, Tyndarius, scourge of the Embersea Isles and former General of the Queen of Monsters ("},{"text":"/join fireplanewar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fire-plane-invasion"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182285","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" The Flame & The Fury, fight to survive the ShadowFlame Onslaught and keep the deposed Avatar of Fire safe ("},{"text":"/join shadowfireplane","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/shadow-fire-plane"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182427","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" Victory is Elementary, battle alongside elemental minions sent by the Avatars to help you ("},{"text":"/join fireinvasion","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fire-invasion"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182551","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV:","bold":true},{"text":" The WarFury's Challenge Gauntlet, fight to prove your skill ("},{"text":"/join wartraining","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/war-training"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182643","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V:","bold":true},{"text":" Fire Realm Invasion Finale, make your way to Tyndarius and stop the Shadowflame Onslaught once and for all ("},{"text":"/join fireavatar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/fire-avatar"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182781","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KF5jg1z2PNc"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mBbKyWOaKRc"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K5OmYnyPvIQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WmB-yz8G2QE"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 5","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1wsCGZuQc4Q"},{"text":"\n"}]}]},{"id":"h.e3tr7kn4df9i","title":"Alliance of Crowns","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182868","runs":[{"text":"Yêu cầu hoàn t","italic":true},{"text":"hành ","italic":true},{"text":"ShadowFlame Onslaught","italic":true},{"text":" để mở","italic":true},{"text":" khoá Storyline này.","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-182935","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I:","bold":true},{"text":" Malgor has corrupted the Mana Core with Shadowflame, and his influence is beginning to spread to all of the living beings in L"},{"text":"ore ("},{"text":"/join ruinedcrown","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/ruined-crown"},{"text":")."},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183096","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II:","bold":true},{"text":" Battle alongside Empress Gravelyn of the ShadowScythe to prevent Malgor from escaping into the Timestream ("},{"text":"/join timekeep","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/time-keep"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183231","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III:","bold":true},{"text":" Get ready for WAR! For the Avatars to help you hunt Malgor, four Elemental Champions needed to serve as their shields, but the strain may destroy them completely ("},{"text":"/join streamwar","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/timestream-war"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183424","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV:","bold":true},{"text":" Hidden deep inside these dead cycles, the ShadowLord is waiting… and so is the full truth about how the Queen of Monsters really died ("},{"text":"/join deadlines","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/deadlines"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183588","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V:","bold":true},{"text":" Princess Tara, she's reappeared as the Champion of Mana! She also has some VERY powerful friends who want to question you AND Malgor. They'll be looking for a reason to hurt you ("},{"text":"/join worldscore","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/world-s-core"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183796","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VI:","bold":true},{"text":" The world as we know it has gone silent; Mana Affliction is spreading across Lore. Defeating Malgor once and for all is the only way to save all those who depend on you ("},{"text":"/join manacradle","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/mana-cradle"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-183997","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part 1","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gp5MYVzBMh4"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 2","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ak6za4YciHw"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 3","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s4NOZazuOd4"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 4","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uf-BrAtBVNQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 5","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H1qX-Ig1K6k"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part 6","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NHBecmsl_BQ"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"next":{"title":"Plane of Monsters: The Queen's Past","url":"/cot-truyen/plane-of-monsters-the-queen-s-past"},"missingImageCount":4}